      "writtenOn": "2018-08-16T15:34:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Overall the change looks good to me. But, is it necessary to add a flag for the low power mode here? I ask because my understanding is that all boards using this PPC driver would want to enable low power mode. Thus, only checking if a driver has provided low power mode callback should be sufficient? Or are you envisioning some boards that might use the driver but not the low power mode?",
